  m_Name: HuntingRule_SO_2
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  RuleTitle_String: Poaching Rules
  RuleDetail_String: "1. Hunt as many targets as you can see on the screen to collect
    their loot.\n\n2. Beware \u2014 some animals will consume the corpses of others.
    If you don\u2019t stop them in time, you\u2019ll lose the chance to loot those
    kills.\r\n\n3. Win conditions are usually based on eliminating specific animals.
    It\u2019s up to you to discover the optimal kill order for the best results.\r\n\n4.
    The same animal may behave differently across different games \u2014 taking on
    roles such as predator, prey, or scavenger.\r\n\n5. Headshots deal Critical Damage.
    Aim for the head to kill faster and earn bonus EXP."
